Subject: [M156] [mime_handler] Return early for uncommitted navigations

Original change's description:
> [mime_handler] Return early for uncommitted navigations
>
> Return early in MimeHandlerStreamManager::DidFinishNavigation() when the
> navigation has not committed, after cleaning up any matching unclaimed
> stream. Otherwise, an uncommitted about:blank navigation in a child
> frame can be treated as the placeholder extension frame and trigger a
> new navigation during renderer process exit.
